  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve school feeding infrastructure in 40 target schools, with approximately 3,600 school children, that face acute challenges in rehabilitating key school feeding infrastructure, such as kitchens, cooking equipment, storerooms, and water systems, which have been severely damaged by the recent storms and floods in Luangnamtha, Phongsaly, Oudomxay, Luangprabang, Sekong, Salavan, and Attapeu Provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
